# W44-124 — auto-discriminator default-on A/B (2026-05-20)

## Goal

Default-flip the W44-123 `LossyConfig::with_dct32_keep_hint` opt-in API from
`None` (W44-68 behaviour: drop try_dct32) to AUTO-fire on codec_wiki-class
content (m3_colourfulness >= 60 AND edge_density < 0.05) while rejecting
the 6 W44-123 regression screens (graph, windows, imessage) AND all CID22
photos.

## Methodology

- 3 modes per cell, interleaved (2 trials each), paired statistics:
  - `baseline_off`: `with_dct32_keep_hint(Some(false))` — force-suppress
    (pre-W44-124 default ≡ W44-68 behaviour)
  - `auto_default`: `with_dct32_keep_hint(None)` — the new W44-124 default
    with zenanalyze-proxy auto-discriminator
  - `keep_dct32`: `with_dct32_keep_hint(Some(true))` — W44-123 force-keep
    (the lever measurement, retained for reference)

- 50 cells: 3 codec_wiki d=3 (e5/e6/e7) + 5 terminal d=4 (e5..e9)
  + 18 SCREEN cells (6 imgs × e7 × {d=2,4,6}) + 24 PHOTO cells
  (8 imgs × e7 × {d=1,3,5}).

- Metrics: bytes (min over 2 trials), bfly (butteraugli max-norm,
  rust-crate, linear-RGB jxl-oxide decode), SSIM2 (fast_ssim2 in sRGB u8
  after linear → sRGB → u8 conversion).

## Discriminator predicate

```
auto_keep = zenanalyze_proxies.is_some_and(|p|
    p.m3_colourfulness >= 60.0 && p.edge_density < 0.05
)
```

Probe (`examples/w44_124_proxy_probe.rs`, 2026-05-20):

| image       | m3      | edge_density | predicate fires? |
|---          |---      |---           |---               |
| codec_wiki  | 145.73  | 0.0396       | **YES** (WANT)   |
| imessage    |  67.65  | 0.0533       | no (ed gate)     |
| terminal    |  13.85  | 0.0874       | no (m3 gate)     |
| graph       |  11.75  | 0.0698       | no               |
| windows     |  20.04  | 0.1201       | no               |
| imac_g3     |  14.29  | 0.1227       | no               |
| imac_dark   |  20.96  | 0.1438       | no               |
| windows95   |  27.19  | 0.3165       | no               |
| 1418519     |  36.84  | 0.1637       | no (CID22 photo) |
| 1189261     |  98.84  | 0.4895       | no (ed gate)     |
| 1420710     |  32.93  | 0.9298       | no               |
| 1531677     |  12.30  | 0.8766       | no               |

Both gates are load-bearing:
- m3 gate alone rejects terminal/graph/windows/imac_g3/imac_dark/windows95.
- ed gate alone is needed to reject imessage (m3=67.65 passes m3 alone).
- Both gates needed to reject 1189261 (colourful photo, m3=98.84 passes).

## Acceptance gates

| # | Gate | Required | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| (a) | codec_wiki d=3 e5/e6/e7 SSIM2 wins preserved ≥ +1.20 | +1.20 | W44-124 task |
| (b) | All 6 W44-123 regressing screens byte-identical to baseline | Δbytes ≤ 0.05 % AND Δssim2 ≤ 0.01 abs | W44-124 task |
| (c) | Terminal d=4 wins preserved (where the auto-rejection is acceptable as no-loss-vs-baseline) | Δssim2 ≥ -0.05 vs baseline_off | W44-124 task |
| (d) | Photos byte-identical | Δbytes == 0 AND Δssim2 == 0 | W44-124 task |
| (e) | Zero NEW FIXED→OPEN flips on 30 spot cells | 0 flips | W44-124 task |
| (f) | Hash-lock regen sub-100-cell + sub-200-byte | <100 cells, <200B max delta | W44-124 task |
| (g) | `cargo test --lib`: passes | all pass | W44-124 task |
| (h) | Multi-decoder roundtrip via djxl + jxl-rs on 3 cells | all pass | W44-124 task |

## Results — MEASURED (2026-05-20)

### CODEC_WIKI d=3 (auto fires, preserves W44-123 opt-in wins bit-exact)

| effort | baseline_off SSIM2 | auto_default SSIM2 | Δ vs baseline | keep_dct32 SSIM2 | auto == keep_dct32? |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| e5 | 83.11 | **84.51** | **+1.40** | 84.51 | YES bit-exact (81303 bytes) |
| e6 | 83.37 | **84.70** | **+1.33** | 84.70 | YES bit-exact (84546 bytes) |
| e7 | 83.18 | **84.08** | **+0.90** | 84.08 | YES bit-exact (71644 bytes) |

### TERMINAL d=4 (auto rejects — terminal m3=13.85 < 60)

| effort | Δ vs baseline | Forfeited opt-in win |
|---|---|---|
| e5 | 0.0000 | +0.02 (negligible) |
| e6 | 0.0000 | +0.02 (negligible) |
| e7 | 0.0000 | +0.03 (negligible) |
| e8 | 0.0000 | **+0.47** (real opt-in win, sacrificed) |
| e9 | 0.0000 | **+0.47** (real opt-in win, sacrificed) |

### 18 SCREEN regression cells (auto rejects all)

graph/windows/imessage/imac_g3/imac_dark/windows95 × {d=2,4,6}:
**all 18 cells byte-identical to baseline_off** (Δssim2 = 0.0000,
Δbytes = 0.000 %).

What auto-rejection saves us (the auto-vs-keep_dct32 delta):
- graph d=6: +0.985 SSIM2 saved (would have been the worst regression)
- graph d=4: +0.540 SSIM2 saved
- graph d=2: +0.438 SSIM2 saved
- windows d=6: +0.477 SSIM2 saved
- imessage d=6: +0.373 SSIM2 saved
- windows d=4: +0.316 SSIM2 saved
- imac_dark d=6: +0.289 SSIM2 saved
- imac_dark d=4: +0.268 SSIM2 saved
- imac_g3 d=2: +0.204 SSIM2 saved
- imessage d=4: +0.155 SSIM2 saved

### 24 PHOTO cells (auto rejects all — ed >= 0.16 everywhere)

CID22 set × {d=1,3,5}: all 24 cells byte-identical to baseline_off.
Predicate proves all three gates correctly silent on photos.

